Package: whatbreach
Version: 0.3.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: git, python, python-pip
Section: recon
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Ekultek/WhatBreach
Description: OSINT tool to discover email breaches
 WhatBreach simplifies discovering which breaches an email address
 has been found in. It can download databases, pastes, and search
 domains for further investigation.
